Requirements
============
 -- CMake 3.16 or later
 -- A C++17-capable compiler
 -- Qt 6 development packages, including Core, Gui, Widgets, OpenGL,
    OpenGLWidgets, Network, Concurrent, Test, and LinguistTools
 -- OpenBabel 3.1 or later (downloaded automatically from
    https://github.com/thosoo/openbabel if not found)
 -- Eigen 3.x
 -- OpenGL and GLU development packages
 -- zlib

Basic Installation
==================
These instructions give a basic overview of how to configure, compile, and
install Avogadro on most systems. If you are using unique install locations
and/or libraries are not automatically detected, consult the Advanced section.

Configure:

   cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo

Build:

   cmake --build build --parallel

Install:

   cmake --install build

To configure, build, and test in the same shape used by CI:

   cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo -DENABLE_TESTS=ON
   cmake --build build --parallel
   ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

Advanced
========
The build system (CMake) provides mechanisms for specifying non-standard
installation locations.

   -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX : specify the installation prefix
                            (default /usr/local)

   -DLIB_INSTALL_DIR : specify the install location for libraries
                       (default ${CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX}/lib)

   OpenBabel will be downloaded and built automatically unless variables such
   as `OpenBabel3_DIR` are set to use an existing installation.

   -DOPENBABEL3_LIBRARIES : specify the OpenBabel 3 libraries (optional)

   -DOPENBABEL3_INCLUDE_DIR : specify the OpenBabel 3 include directory (optional)

   -DEIGEN3_INCLUDE_DIR : specify the Eigen include directory (also forwarded
                          to the bundled Open Babel build)

   The following variables are also passed to the bundled Open Babel build when
   defined. They allow overriding dependency locations:
     INCHI_INCLUDE_DIR / INCHI_LIBRARY
     CAIRO_INCLUDE_DIRS / CAIRO_LIBRARIES
     RAPIDJSON_INCLUDE_DIRS
     MAEPARSER_DIR (with maeparser_INCLUDE_DIRS/maeparser_LIBRARIES)
     coordgen_DIR (with coordgen_INCLUDE_DIRS/coordgen_LIBRARIES)
     LIBXML2_INCLUDE_DIR / LIBXML2_LIBRARIES
     ZLIB_INCLUDE_DIR / ZLIB_LIBRARY
     wxWidgets_LIB_DIR
     LIB_INSTALL_DIR

Useful options:

   -DENABLE_PYTHON=ON/OFF      Enable or disable Boost.Python integration
                               (default ON when dependencies are found)
   -DENABLE_TESTS=ON/OFF       Enable or disable unit tests (default OFF)
   -DENABLE_GLSL=ON/OFF        Enable or disable GLSL shader support (default OFF)
   -DENABLE_THREADEDGL=ON/OFF  Enable or disable threaded OpenGL rendering
                               (default OFF)
   -DENABLE_UPDATE_CHECKER=ON/OFF
                               Enable or disable network update checks
                               (default OFF)

For more information please consult the CMake documentation.

Avogadro uses a few environment variables to find things at runtime. If Avogadro
is installed to the location specified at compile time none of these variables
need to be set.

AVOGADRO_TRANSLATIONS - the location of the translation files.
BABEL_LIBDIR - the location of Open Babel format plugins
BABEL_DATADIR - the location of Open Babel data files
